  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nStep into the artistic haven of Kraken Tattoo, nestled in the heart of San Sebastián, Spain, where intricate fineline, mesmerizing dotwork, and imaginative illustrative tattoos come to life. With a team of resident artists including the likes of Alejandro Florez, Musegam, Balea, Psychobeni, and Hezurra, along with illustrious collaborators Fea.333, Garm Black, and Psicosudu, Kraken Tattoo is a sanctuary for those seeking a unique ink experience by the sea.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: San Sebastián, Basque Country, Spain"
